{"id":"u-90270e8e-513f-491a-8f7f-176c12909dec","src":"community","title":"Mike Mentzer Ideal Baseline Routine","author":"Mysteryman A.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/ZvoOzn-mike-mentzer-ideal-baseline-routine","desc":"Mike Mentzer: The intellectual bodybuilder outlined his philosophy of training based on his experiences with Arthur Jones and Casey Viator as well as his Philosophy of Objectivism I encourage anyone running this program to research Mike Mentzer.\n\nI believe although this is a very interesting way to train it might not be optimal for everyone but it is worth a try for anyone to help find minimum effective volume or if HIT is good for you so although Mentzer was on the right track everyone is different so run the program and see if you are progressing\n\n\nThe workout is on and 3 days off: Monday to Friday then to Tuesday and so forth after 3 weeks insert additional rest day and keep doing so as growing until you training every 7 days. \n\"Train to failure eat a balanced diet and pray\" - Mike Mentzer which is basically the entire program","level":["Beginner","Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":20,"joins":6,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-21T23:01:51.548Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest + Back","Legs","Delta + Arms","Legs"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"r":8}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"r":3}]},{"n":"Underhand Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":8}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"r":8}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":8}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6}]},{"n":"Reverse Pec Deck","sets":[{"r":6}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":6}]},{"n":"Dips Between Chairs","sets":[{"r":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"r":8}]},{"n":"Squat (Ba